*
* Model Usage Notes:
*
* A. The following features have been modeled
*   1.  Output Voltage Setting
*   2.  Frequency Selection
*   3.  Internal Fixed Soft-Start
*   4.  Minimum ON-Time, Minimum OFF-Time and Frequency Foldback
*   5.  Low-side FET Zero-Crossing
*	6. 	Current Sense and Positive Overcurrent Protection(OCP)
*	7. 	Over Voltage Protection(OVP)
*	8.  Power Good
*	9.  UVLO Protection
*	10. BOOT functionality
* 	   
*
* B. Features have not been modelled
*	1. Operating Quiescent Current
*   2. Shutdown Current 
*   3. Temperature dependent characteristics
*   4. Steady State
*   5. Ground pins have been tied to 0V internally.Therefore, this model cannot 
*      be used for inverting topologies.
